    placement: each marker sits inside a single base-color block, Chebyshev distance >=1 to any other-base cell
    constraint: 8-neighbors must have a unique majority base color (not on block boundary)
    color_mapping: bijection between 2 base colors and 2 marker colors
  transform:
    rule: for each marker pixel, activate both full diagonals (NW-SE, NE-SW) to grid edges
    recolor: each activated base-color cell becomes its paired marker color; original markers unchanged

generation_strategy:
